RE: Alchemist Class

This alchemist idea is pretty exciting. Balance is the hard part, but I
think you could make it a terrible fighter who specializes in throwing
things--like potions--but who is a lousy melee fighter. I'm thinking of
a chaotic orc alchemist as being like the Green Goblin (sans super
strength and cool flying thingy) or a human lawful chemist being like
Jonas Salk, looking for the Amulet to create a formula to stop a
world-wide plague.

Perhaps give it a couple of specialty potions to mix for when fighting
is unavoidable so it can go Mr. Hyde on a dragon.

This class gets my imagination going. Keep up the good suggestions.



